    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrpMNPbk0_JIVpTmZ3hy-BHdzCEb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>第七期播客，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们来聊《</span><strong><span>人生大事</span></strong><span>》，</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及同类题材的《</span><strong><span>入殓师</span></strong><span>》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>片中老爷子的临终遗言说：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“人生除了生死无大事！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>而生与死偏偏又都不由自己做主</span></p><span></span><p><span>死亡是一件看似神秘，</span></p><span></span><p><span>却人人都要经历的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁将陪伴我们走过这一生，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们又将如何和这个世界告别？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们就来一起聊聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>——“生与死”</span></p><span></span><p><span>这两件人生大事~</span><strong><br><span> </span><br><span> </span></strong><em><strong><span>下午茶都在聊些啥？</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span></strong></em><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>片头小广告:人际团体招募啦!</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>相互理解是亲密关系的基石</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>换位思考帮助父母走近孩子的心</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>哀悼是为了告别，告别需要仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>♥ </span></strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>世间所有存在消亡才是真正的死亡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>♥ </span></strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2689">44:49</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>团体让我们找到归属和存在感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS：这期讨论的是啥呀？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>电影《人生大事》&amp;《入殓师》，剧透警告，没看过的伙伴建议观看后再听节目哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ending为朱一龙演唱的《人生大事》电影同名主题曲</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS2：人生除了生死大事还有很多烦恼怎么办？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——如果你有人际关系方面的困扰，可以考虑来三妮和丫头共同带领的亚隆人际团体试试，安全有边界的团体环境，带你体验人际关系中的温暖和张力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对团体好奇的你，还可以听下我们另一档播客《忘忧十二夜》，陪你观察十二周团体中发生的喜怒哀乐~</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>神经姐姐”们是谁？</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><strong><span>三妮：</span></strong><span>大地系团体带领者，六十分心理咨询师。（VX公众号：三妮的阳光小屋）</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><strong><span>由一：</span></strong><span>自由执业的二级心理师，一脸正经的叛逆少年。（VX公众号：由心阁）</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><strong><span>维佳：</span></strong><span>厨房里的女混子，二级心理师，躺平爱好者。（VX公众号：正心塘）</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><strong><span>丫头：</span></strong><span>爱好探索与体验，擅长跨界与融合，一个你想不到她会些什么的心理咨询师。（VX公众号：骑鲸游）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS：为啥是“神经姐姐”?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——没点“病”都不好意思说自己是心理咨询师！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——“神经病人”欢乐多，“神经姐姐”爱唠磕~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FufMTTTyundUT93kk-4krwdHXv5b.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>收听之后如果有什么感触，可以给我们评论留言~催更也许让我们更有动力，也许会假装没看到！</span></p><span></span><p><span>有关团体的疑问，可以留言，或者直接跟我们的公众号联系哦~</span></p>]]></description>
