    <title>Vol.004 春日迟迟再出发：面对伤害与遗憾，道歉有用吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6277d88edbea6a194d842c0a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6277d88edbea6a194d842c0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 May 2022 14:49:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FrpMNPbk0_JIVpTmZ3hy-BHdzCEb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“神经姐姐的下午茶”第四期播客，</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><strong><span>春日迟迟再出发</span></strong><span>》开启心动模式，</span></p><span></span><p><span>一对一的约会中，</span></p><span></span><p><span>终于能单独面对心仪的TA。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人突破自我直球表白，</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人依旧纠结迂回试探，</span></p><span></span><p><span>对彼此的心意大白于天下，</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人受伤难过，有人困惑不解，</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有那么多错过和遗憾，</span></p><span></span><p><span>想要道歉和弥补。</span></p><span></span><p><span>成年人的复杂关系如何处理？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起来听听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>下午茶都在聊些啥？</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>开心！小宇宙订阅爆啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>是造化弄人，还是潜意识即命运？</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>对爱情小心翼翼，对友谊豪爽大气</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>理解对方的痛苦，才能真诚地道歉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>♥ </span></strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1903">31:43</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>放下对与错的执念，接纳负面情绪</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>♥ &nbsp;</span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2786">46:26</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>觉察关系中行为模式是自我的修行</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS：讨论的是啥节目呀？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>芒果台《春日迟迟再出发》，建议观看后再听节目哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ending为同名片尾曲 &nbsp;演唱、词曲：朱雅琼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS2：潜意识即命运？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——很多时候我们以为是自我意志的选择，并没有觉察到潜意识具有强大的影响力，你的每一个行动或想法，其实都事出有“因”。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS3：为何要接纳情绪？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——一切现象皆为条件，情绪是自然生发的产物，并不以你想要或不想要来决定。过份的压抑或忽略情绪，并不能让情绪消失，而会以身体为代价来消化它。情绪像水一样，流动起来就会自然消退。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>“神经姐姐”们是谁？</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><strong><span>三妮：</span></strong><span>大地系团体带领者，六十分心理咨询师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><strong><span>由一：</span></strong><span>自由执业的二级心理师，一脸正经的叛逆少年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><strong><span>维佳：</span></strong><span>厨房里的女混子，二级心理师，躺平爱好者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><strong><span>丫头：</span></strong><span>爱好探索与体验，擅长跨界与融合，一个你想不到她会些什么的心理咨询师。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS：为啥是“神经姐姐”？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——没点“病”都不好意思说自己是心理咨询师！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——“神经病人”欢乐多，“神经姐姐”爱唠磕~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS2：特别鸣谢！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——后期剪辑：BOBO</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FufMTTTyundUT93kk-4krwdHXv5b.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
