    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FrpMNPbk0_JIVpTmZ3hy-BHdzCEb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“神经姐姐的下午茶”第三期播客，</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><strong><span>春日迟迟再出发</span></strong><span>》行程过半，</span></p><span></span><p><span>在一对一的匿名真心话中，</span></p><span></span><p><span>体验成年人的恋爱方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>进一步担心你的拒绝，</span></p><span></span><p><span>退一步又会遗憾错过，</span></p><span></span><p><span>摇摆中的双人舞，</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎样才能踩准节奏和谐共舞？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起来听听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>下午茶都在聊些啥？</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>Say hello！</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>扑朔迷离的CP局，各种遗憾和错过！</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>成年人的“暧昧”和少年感的“直球”</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;“</span></strong><span>命运”的捉弄让人意难平！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>♥ </span></strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>分离焦虑，让我们无法好好说分手~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>♥ </span></strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> </span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>自我的觉察和反思，是成长的必经之路</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS：讨论的是啥节目呀？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>芒果台《春日迟迟再出发》，建议观看后再听节目哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ending为同名片尾曲 &nbsp;演唱、词曲：朱雅琼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS2：啥是分离焦虑？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——因和亲近的人分离而产生的焦虑不安的情绪，常见于婴幼儿，如果幼年经常体验到这样的感受而造成的分离创伤，在成年以后也会经常重复体验到哦！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS3：什么是“灯下黑”？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——指照明时由于被灯具自身遮挡，在灯下产生阴暗区域。现引申为人们对发生在身边很近事物和事件没有看见和察觉。</span></p>]]></description>
