    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FrpMNPbk0_JIVpTmZ3hy-BHdzCEb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>“神经姐姐的下午茶”第二期播客，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们继续聊《</span><strong><span>春日迟迟再出发</span></strong><span>》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>只有“完美”才值得被爱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么“六十分妈妈”就足够了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>放下完美，走向真实自我，</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起来听听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>下午茶都在聊些啥？</span><br><span></span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><span><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span></span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>Say hello！</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><span><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> </span></span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>完美产生距离，有缺点的人才真实！</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥ </span><span><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> </span></span><span>分手的理由竟然是对方太好了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>♥&nbsp;</span><span><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> </span></span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>我也可以做一个有缺点的人！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>♥&nbsp;</span></strong><span><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a> </span></span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>享受成年人的爱情需要成长自己~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>♥&nbsp;</span></strong><span><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> </span></span><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong><span>放下对女性身份的苛责，六十分万岁！</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS：讨论的是啥节目呀？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>芒果台《春日迟迟再出发》，建议观看后再听节目哦~Ending为同名片尾曲&nbsp;&nbsp;演唱、词曲：朱雅琼</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS2：啥是不安全依恋？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——在关系中要么焦虑抓狂，要么冷淡疏离，与人无法保持舒服距离，你可能是不安全的依恋类型哦！</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PS3：“六十分妈妈”就够了？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——来自心理学家温尼科特，妈妈不需要完美，只要足够好即可，伴随孩子长大，妈妈也需要退场。</span></p>]]></description>
